#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GCC"
msgstr "Instalação do GCC"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:46
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As in the first build of GCC, the GMP, MPFR, and MPC packages are required. "
"Unpack the tarballs and move them into the required directories:"
msgstr ""
"Como na primeira construção do GCC, os pacotes GMP, MPFR e MPC são exigidos."
" Desempacote os tarballs e mova-os para os diretórios exigidos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:49
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">tar -xf ../mpfr-&mpfr-version;.tar.xz\n"
"mv -v mpfr-&mpfr-version; mpfr\n"
"tar -xf ../gmp-&gmp-version;.tar.xz\n"
"mv -v gmp-&gmp-version; gmp\n"
"tar -xf ../mpc-&mpc-version;.tar.gz\n"
"mv -v mpc-&mpc-version; mpc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">tar -xf ../mpfr-&mpfr-version;.tar.xz\n"
"mv -v mpfr-&mpfr-version; mpfr\n"
"tar -xf ../gmp-&gmp-version;.tar.xz\n"
"mv -v gmp-&gmp-version; gmp\n"
"tar -xf ../mpc-&mpc-version;.tar.gz\n"
"mv -v mpc-&mpc-version; mpc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:56
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are building on x86_64, change the default directory name for 64-bit "
"libraries to <quote>lib</quote>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver construindo em x86_64, mude o nome padrão de diretório para "
"bibliotecas de 64 bits para <quote>lib</quote>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:59
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">case $(uname -m) in\n"
"  x86_64)\n"
"    sed -e '/m64=/s/lib64/lib/' \\\n"
"        -i.orig gcc/config/i386/t-linux64\n"
"  ;;\n"
"esac</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">case $(uname -m) in\n"
"  x86_64)\n"
"    sed -e '/m64=/s/lib64/lib/' \\\n"
"        -i.orig gcc/config/i386/t-linux64\n"
"  ;;\n"
"esac</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:66
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Override the build rules of the libgcc and libstdc++ headers to allow "
"building these libraries with POSIX threads support:"
msgstr ""
"Substitua as regras de construção dos cabeçalhos da libgcc e da libstdc++ "
"para permitir construir essas bibliotecas com suporte a camadas POSIX:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:69
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed '/thread_header =/s/@.*@/gthr-posix.h/' \\\n"
"    -i libgcc/Makefile.in libstdc++-v3/include/Makefile.in</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed '/thread_header =/s/@.*@/gthr-posix.h/' \\\n"
"    -i libgcc/Makefile.in libstdc++-v3/include/Makefile.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid "Create a separate build directory again:"
msgstr "Crie um diretório de construção separado novamente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:74
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -v build\n"
"cd       build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -v build\n"
"cd      build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Before starting to build GCC, remember to unset any environment variables "
"that override the default optimization flags."
msgstr ""
"Antes de iniciar a construção do GCC, lembre-se de desconfigurar quaisquer "
"variáveis de ambiente que substituam os sinalizadores de otimização padrão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "Now prepare GCC for compilation:"
msgstr "Agora prepare o GCC para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:82
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">../configure                   \\\n"
"    --build=$(../config.guess) \\\n"
"    --host=$LFS_TGT            \\\n"
"    --target=$LFS_TGT          \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"    --with-build-sysroot=$LFS  \\\n"
"    --enable-default-pie       \\\n"
"    --enable-default-ssp       \\\n"
"    --disable-nls              \\\n"
"    --disable-multilib         \\\n"
"    --disable-libatomic        \\\n"
"    --disable-libgomp          \\\n"
"    --disable-libquadmath      \\\n"
"    --disable-libsanitizer     \\\n"
"    --disable-libssp           \\\n"
"    --disable-libvtv           \\\n"
"    --enable-languages=c,c++   \\\n"
"    LDFLAGS_FOR_TARGET=-L$PWD/$LFS_TGT/libgcc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">../configure                   \\\n"
"    --build=$(../config.guess) \\\n"
"    --host=$LFS_TGT            \\\n"
"    --target=$LFS_TGT          \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"    --with-build-sysroot=$LFS  \\\n"
"    --enable-default-pie       \\\n"
"    --enable-default-ssp       \\\n"
"    --disable-nls              \\\n"
"    --disable-multilib         \\\n"
"    --disable-libatomic        \\\n"
"    --disable-libgomp          \\\n"
"    --disable-libquadmath      \\\n"
"    --disable-libsanitizer     \\\n"
"    --disable-libssp           \\\n"
"    --disable-libvtv           \\\n"
"    --enable-languages=c,c++   \\\n"
"    LDFLAGS_FOR_TARGET=-L$PWD/$LFS_TGT/libgcc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-build-sysroot=$LFS</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-build-sysroot=$LFS</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Normally, using <parameter>--host</parameter> ensures that a cross-compiler "
"is used for building GCC, and that compiler knows that it has to look for "
"headers and libraries in <filename class=\"directory\">$LFS</filename>. "
"However, the build system for GCC uses additional tools which are not aware "
"of this location. This switch is needed so those tools will find the needed "
"files in <filename class=\"directory\">$LFS</filename>, and not on the host."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, usar <parameter>--host</parameter> garante que um compilador "
"cruzado seja usado para construir o GCC e que o compilador sabe que tem que "
"procurar por cabeçalhos e por bibliotecas em <filename class=\"directory\""
">$LFS</filename>. Porém, o sistema de construção para o GCC usa ferramentas "
"adicionais, que não estão cientes desse local. Essa chave é necessária, de "
"forma que tais ferramentas procurarão pelos arquivos necessários em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$LFS</filename>, e não no anfitrião."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--target=$LFS_TGT</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--target=$LFS_TGT</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"We are cross-compiling GCC, so it's impossible to build target libraries "
"(<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgcc</filename> and <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libstdc++</filename>) with the GCC binaries compiled "
"in this pass&mdash;those binaries won't run on the host.  The GCC build "
"system will attempt to use the host's C and C++ compilers as a workaround by"
" default.  Building the GCC target libraries with a different version of GCC"
" is not supported, so using the host's compilers may cause the build to "
"fail. This parameter ensures the libraries are built by GCC pass 1."
msgstr ""
"Nós estamos compilando cruzadamente o GCC, de forma que é impossível "
"construir bibliotecas alvo (<filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libgcc</filename> e <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libstdc++</filename>) com os binários do GCC "
"compilados nesta passagem&mdash;esses binários não executariam no anfitrião."
" O sistema de construção do GCC tentará usar os compiladores C e C++ do "
"anfitrião como uma solução alternativa por padrão. Construir as bibliotecas "
"alvo do GCC com uma versão diferente do GCC não é suportado, de forma que "
"usar os compiladores do anfitrião possivelmente cause falha de construção. "
"Esse parâmetro assegura que as bibliotecas sejam construídas pelo GCC "
"passagem 1."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>LDFLAGS_FOR_TARGET=...</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>LDFLAGS_FOR_TARGET=...</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Allow <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libstdc++</filename> to use the "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgcc</filename> being built in this pass, "
"instead of the previous version built in <xref linkend='ch-tools-gcc-"
"pass1'/>.  The previous version cannot properly support C++ exception "
"handling because it was built without libc support."
msgstr ""
"Permite que <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libstdc++</filename> use o "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgcc</filename> sendo construído nessa "
"passagem, em vez da versão anterior construída em <xref linkend='ch-tools-"
"gcc-pass1'/>. A versão anterior não pode suportar adequadamente o tratamento"
" de exceções C++ porque foi construída sem suporte a libc."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-libsanitizer</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-libsanitizer</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Disable GCC sanitizer runtime libraries.  They are not needed for the "
"temporary installation.  In <xref linkend='ch-tools-gcc-pass1'/> it was "
"implied by <parameter>--disable-libstdcxx</parameter>, and now we can "
"explicitly pass it."
msgstr ""
"Desabilita as bibliotecas sanitizadoras de tempo de execução do GCC. Elas "
"não são necessárias para a instalação temporária. Em <xref linkend='ch-"
"tools-gcc-pass1'/> estava implícito por <parameter>--disable-"
"libstdcxx</parameter> e agora temos que passá-lo explicitamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As a finishing touch, create a utility symlink. Many programs and scripts "
"run <command>cc</command> instead of <command>gcc</command>, which is used "
"to keep programs generic and therefore usable on all kinds of UNIX systems "
"where the GNU C compiler is not always installed. Running "
"<command>cc</command> leaves the system administrator free to decide which C"
" compiler to install:"
msgstr ""
"Como um toque final, crie um link simbólico utilitário. Muitos aplicativos e"
" scripts executam <command>cc</command> em vez de <command>gcc</command>, o "
"que é usado para manter genéricos os aplicativos e, assim, utilizáveis em "
"todos os tipos de sistemas UNIX onde o compilador GNU C nem sempre está "
"instalado. Executar <command>cc</command> deixa o(a) administrador(a) do "
"sistema livre para decidir qual compilador C instalar:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:173
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sv gcc $LFS/usr/bin/cc</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sv gcc $LFS/usr/bin/cc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/gcc-pass2.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Details on this package are located in <xref linkend=\"contents-gcc\" "
"role=\".\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Detalhes acerca deste pacote estão localizados na <xref linkend=\"contents-"
"gcc\" role=\".\"/>"

